    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Devi, you'll navigate through a web of lies and deceit, using your sharp wit and logical deduction skills. Manage and sort through your comprehensive conversation log, using key pieces of information as evidence to interrogate suspects. The fate of your friend hangs in the balance \u2013 can you connect the dots before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a rich, story-driven experience set in contemporary rural India </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employ keen detective skills to investigate crime scenes, gather clues, and uncover leads </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge suspects with intense cross-examinations, using your meticulously organized conversation log as evidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make critical decisions that impact the course of your investigation and potentially save a life </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore intricately designed environments teeming with cultural insights and dark secrets </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be the light that pierces through the darkness of a small village's secrets? Your journey to uncover the truth and save your friend begins now in &quot;Devi: A Light in the Dark.&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Devi, you'll navigate through a web of lies and deceit, using your sharp wit and logical deduction skills. Manage and sort through your comprehensive conversation log, using key pieces of information as evidence to interrogate suspects. The fate of your friend hangs in the balance \u2013 can you connect the dots before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a rich, story-driven experience set in contemporary rural India </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employ keen detective skills to investigate crime scenes, gather clues, and uncover leads </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge suspects with intense cross-examinations, using your meticulously organized conversation log as evidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make critical decisions that impact the course of your investigation and potentially save a life </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore intricately designed environments teeming with cultural insights and dark secrets </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be the light that pierces through the darkness of a small village's secrets? Your journey to uncover the truth and save your friend begins now in &quot;Devi: A Light in the Dark.&quot;</p>",
